<title>UK: Cricket-Australia vs England 2nd Test scoreboard.</title>
<headline>Cricket-Australia vs England 2nd Test scoreboard.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the final  day of the second test between England and Australia at Lord's on Monday:</p>
<p>England first innings 77 (G.McGrath 8-38)</p>
<p>Australia first innings (overnight 213-7)  M.Taylor b Gough			    1</p>
<p> M.Elliott c Crawley b Caddick	 112</p>
